  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfenced><mtext>x</mtext></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mtext>x</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mtext>x</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mrow><mo>⇒&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo> <mo>for</mo> <mtext>y</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mn>7</mn> <mtext>,&nbsp;&nbsp;</mtext> <mtext>x</mtext> <mo>&gt;</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo> <mn>7</mn> <mo>=</mo> <msup> <mtext>x</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>x</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mn>5</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>⇒&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo> <msup> <mtext>x</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>x</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mo>=</mo> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>⇒&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>x</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>x</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>⇒&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo> <mtext>x</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>1, 2</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>⇒</mo> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;(as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is rejected)<br /><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>&amp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi>f&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r,</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></msub></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></math><br /><br />substituting <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> in this equation,<br /><br />we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>.</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>at</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p>",
